---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import dealer from '../data/dealer.json';

const updatedDate = 'May 19, 2026';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Nakaja Bikes"
  description="Terms of use for the Nakaja Bikes website, motorcycle information, showroom contact, WhatsApp, Messenger, and financing inquiry flows."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <section class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary-container mb-4">Terms Of Use</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-black text-white uppercase mb-6">Clear Terms For Using This Site</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">This website helps riders compare UM motorcycles, contact Nakaja Bikes, request callbacks, and start financing or showroom conversations.</p>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mt-6">Last updated: {updatedDate}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.35fr_1fr] gap-10 border-t border-metal/20 pt-10">
      <aside class="text-secondary font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
        Nakaja Bikes<br />
        Authorized UM Dealer
      </aside>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <section aria-labelledby="terms-use-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-use-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Using The Website</h2>
          <p>Use this website for genuine motorcycle, financing, service, and showroom inquiries. Do not misuse forms, send harmful code, attempt unauthorized access, or submit false information.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="terms-info-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-info-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Motorcycle Information</h2>
          <p>We work to keep product details, prices, deposits, warranty notes, and availability useful and current. Final details must be confirmed directly with Nakaja Bikes before purchase, booking, financing, or delivery.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="terms-financing-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-financing-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Financing Conversations</h2>
          <p>Financing information on this website is for guidance. Rates, deposits, repayment terms, approval, and required documents are controlled by financing partners and may change. Confirm the current offer with Nakaja Bikes and the financing partner before committing.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="terms-contact-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-contact-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">WhatsApp, Messenger, And Calls</h2>
          <p>When you contact Nakaja through WhatsApp, Messenger, phone, forms, or email, you agree that we may respond using the details you provide. Message and data charges may apply through your network or platform provider.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="terms-links-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-links-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>The site may connect you to Meta services, WhatsApp, Messenger, map links, financing partners, hosting providers, or other third-party tools. Their own terms and policies may also apply.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="terms-contact-us-heading">
          <h2 id="terms-contact-us-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Contact Nakaja</h2>
          <p>For questions about these terms, contact {dealer.dealer} at <a href={`mailto:${dealer.email}`} class="text-white underline decoration-primary-container underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary">{dealer.email}</a>, call {dealer.phoneDisplay}, or visit {dealer.location}.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
